[15.148937, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.266463, "o", "VibeGuard live interception demo: safe-bash\r\nHook source: installed snapshot\r\nAI requests Bash:\r\n  $ rm -rf $HOME\r\n\r\n-> PreToolUse(Bash) -> pre-bash-guard.sh\r\nDENIED: decision=block\r\n"]
[15.266535, "o", "Reason: VIBEGUARD interception: Prohibit rm -rf dangerous paths (the root directory, home directory, and system directory are not recoverable). Alternatives: rm -rf <specific deep subdirectory> specifies the exact path; rm -ri interactively confirms; first confirm the target with ls and then delete it.\r\n\r\nOK: shell executor was never started\r\nOK: temporary HOME marker remains intact\r\n"]
